tems-center justify-center gap-4 border border-light-gold bg-image-blue p-8 text-center ui-landing-card-shadow lg:col-span-3"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">There&#39;s no risk, cancel anytime</h2><p class="max-w-sm text-muted-foreground"> We don&#39;t tolerate unhappy students: ask for a refund within 30 days and it&#39;s yours </p></div></div><!--]--></div></section><div class="absolute w-full bg-center -mt-4" style="background-image:url(/_nuxt/woodendivider.CUsRAV17.webp);height:23px;" src="/_nuxt/woodendivider.CUsRAV17.webp" alt="Wooden Divider"></div><section class="bg-image-blue"><!--[--><!--]--><div class="container mx-auto flex flex-col items-center px-4 pb-24 text-shadow-sm lg:pb-28 pt-16 lg:pt-24"><!----><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><h2 class="max-w-xs text-xl leading-none text-foreground-strong lg:max-w-2xl lg:text-4xl">Software developers in the US earn over $100,000 per year</h2><h3 class="font-style-normal mt-6 max-w-xs text-base text-foreground md:max-w-lg lg:text-xl">The following data is taken from the results of the 2025 Stack Overflow survey</h3><!----></div><div class="mt-4 sm:mt-8 lg:mt-10"></div><!--[--><div class="flex max-w-2xl flex-col gap-8 px-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground"><div class="w-full space-y-2"><!--[--><div class="flex items-center space-x-4"><div class="w-44 shrink-0 text-right text-sm"><p class="font-bold text-foreground">Cloud Engineer</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">$189,000</p></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="h-6 lg:h-7"><div class="progress-bar h-full w-full rounded-full p-1 border border-gray-750 light:border-border"><div class="progress-bar-track h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gray-800 light:bg-progress-track"><div class="rounded-full shadow-md transition-[width] motion-reduce:transition-none h-full bg-texture-blue border-2" style="width:0%;transition-duration:2000ms;"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center space-x-4"><div class="w-44 shrink-0 text-right text-sm"><p class="font-bold text-foreground">Backend Developer</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">$175,000</p></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="h-6 lg:h-7"><div class="progress-bar h-full w-full rounded-full p-1 border border-gray-750 light:border-border"><div class="progress-bar-track h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gray-800 light:bg-progress-track"><div class="rounded-full shadow-md transition-[width] motion-reduce:transition-none h-full bg-texture-blue border-2" style="width:0%;transition-duration:2000ms;"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center space-x-4"><div class="w-44 shrink-0 text-right text-sm"><p class="font-bold text-foreground">Site Reliability Engineer</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">$165,000</p></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="h-6 lg:h-7"><div class="progress-bar h-full w-full rounded-full p-1 border border-gray-750 light:border-border"><div class="progress-bar-track h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gray-800 light:bg-progress-track"><div class="rounded-full shadow-md transition-[width] motion-reduce:transition-none h-full bg-texture-blue border-2" style="width:0%;transition-duration:2000ms;"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center space-x-4"><div class="w-44 shrink-0 text-right text-sm"><p class="font-bold text-foreground">DevOps Engineer</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">$165,000</p></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="h-6 lg:h-7"><div class="progress-bar h-full w-full rounded-full p-1 border border-gray-750 light:border-border"><div class="progress-bar-track h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gray-800 light:bg-progress-track"><div class="rounded-full shadow-md transition-[width] motion-reduce:transition-none h-full bg-texture-blue border-2" style="width:0%;transition-duration:2000ms;"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center space-x-4"><div class="w-44 shrink-0 text-right text-sm"><p class="font-bold text-foreground">Data Engineer</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">$150,000</p></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="h-6 lg:h-7"><div class="progress-bar h-full w-full rounded-full p-1 border border-gray-750 light:border-border"><div class="progress-bar-track h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gray-800 light:bg-progress-track"><div class="rounded-full shadow-md transition-[width] motion-reduce:transition-none h-full bg-texture-blue border-2" style="width:0%;transition-duration:2000ms;"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center space-x-4"><div class="w-44 shrink-0 text-right text-sm"><p class="font-bold text-foreground">Frontend Developer</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">$145,000</p></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="h-6 lg:h-7"><div class="progress-bar h-full w-full rounded-full p-1 border border-gray-750 light:border-border"><div class="progress-bar-track h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gray-800 light:bg-progress-track"><div class="rounded-full shadow-md transition-[width] motion-reduce:transition-none h-full bg-texture-blue border-2" style="width:0%;transition-duration:2000ms;"></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center space-x-4"><div class="w-44 shrink-0 text-right text-sm"><p class="font-bold text-foreground">Data Analyst</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">$100,956</p></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="h-6 lg:h-7"><div class="progress-bar h-full w-full rounded-full p-1 border border-gray-750 light:border-border"><div class="progress-bar-track h-full w-full overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-gray-800 light:bg-progress-track"><div class="rounded-full shadow-md transition-[width] motion-reduce:transition-none h-full bg-texture-blue border-2" style="width:0%;transition-duration:2000ms;"></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p> Some folks look at <a href="https://survey.stackoverflow.co/2025/work#salary-comp-total-united-states" target="_blank" class="textlink">the job data</a> and assume that front-end positions are the only option for new learners. On the contrary, there is big demand for backend, data, and other software positions! </p><p> If you like working with data, logic, servers, and solving hard problems, you might just enjoy the curriculum here on Boot.dev. And similar to the frontend, most backend and data positions don&#39;t require a specific degree from a university... but you do need to know your stuff! </p></div></div><div class="mt-4 flex justify-center"><!--[--><div class="mt-8 mb-16 flex flex-col items-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><a href="/demo" class="arcuata group relative flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-xs border-2 ui-hero-button px-9 py-3 text-center text-base font-bold tracking-widest whitespace-nowrap focus:outline-hidden" tabindex="-1"><div class="absolute left-0 hidden border-y-8 border-l-8 border-y-transparent ui-hero-decoration group-focus-within:block group-hover:block"></div><div class="absolute right-0 hidden border-y-8 border-r-8 border-y-transparent ui-hero-decoration group-focus-within:block group-hover:block"></div><button class="uppercase focus:outline-hidden"><!--[--><!--[-->WRITE SOME CODE<!--]--><!--]--></button></a></div><span class="text-muted-foreground"> (it takes 2 minutes) </span></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><div class="absolute w-full bg-center -mt-4" style="background-image:url(/_nuxt/woodendivider.CUsRAV17.webp);height:23px;" src="/_nuxt/woodendivider.CUsRAV17.webp" alt="Wooden Divider"></div><section class="bg-image-blue-gray"><!--[--><!--]--><div class="container mx-auto flex flex-col items-center px-4 pb-24 text-shadow-sm lg:pb-28 pt-16 lg:pt-24"><!----><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><h2 class="max-w-xs text-xl leading-none text-foreground-strong lg:max-w-2xl lg:text-4xl">Don&#39;t just learn, prepare for real jobs</h2><h3 class="font-style-normal mt-6 max-w-xs text-base text-foreground md:max-w-lg lg:text-xl">Grind our practice challenges, mock interviews, and quizzes so you can ace your interviews.</h3><!----></div><div class="mt-4 sm:mt-8 lg:mt-10"></div><!--[--><div class="w-full max-w-3xl"><p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-2xl px-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground"> While personal projects are important, AI has pushed employers to rely more on <em>live</em> evaluations. Real-time coding challenges, whiteboard interviews, and &quot;talk me through your code&quot; sessions are the norm. </p><div class="mb-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 text-lg md:grid-cols-2"><div class="textlg p-3 text-muted-foreground"><div class="mb-2 flex ui-feature-icon"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide h-7 w-7 lucide-code-icon lucide-code h-7 w-7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m16 18 6-6-6-6"></path><path d="m8 6-6 6 6 6"></path></svg><!--]--></div><p class="text-bold text-xl text-foreground-strong">Coding challenges</p><p>Implement a solution from scratch in a live coding environment</p></div><div class="textlg p-3 text-muted-foreground"><div class="mb-2 flex ui-feature-icon"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide h-7 w-7 lucide-bug-icon lucide-bug h-7 w-7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20v-9"></path><path d="M14 7a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v3a6 6 0 0 1-12 0v-3a4 4 0 0 1 4-4z"></path><path d="M14.12 3.88 16 2"></path><path d="M21 21a4 4 0 0 0-3.81-4"></path><path d="M21 5a4 4 0 0 1-3.55 3.97"></path><path d="M22 13h-4"></path><path d="M3 21a4 4 0 0 1 3.81-4"></path><path d="M3 5a4 4 0 0 0 3.55 3.97"></path><path d="M6 13H2"></path><path d="m8 2 1.88 1.88"></path><path d="M9 7.13V6a3 3 0 1 1 6 0v1.13"></path></svg><!--]--></div><p class="text-bold text-xl text-foreground-strong">Fix the bug</p><p>Debug broken code to find the issue and prove your understanding</p></div><div class="textlg p-3 text-muted-foreground"><div class="mb-2 flex ui-feature-icon"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide h-7 w-7 lucide-message-circle-icon lucide-message-circle h-7 w-7" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719"></path></svg><!--]--></div><p class="text-bold text-xl text-foreground-strong">Mock interviews</p><p>Explain concepts like you would to an interviewer with instant feedback</p></div><div class="textlg p-3 text-muted-foreground"><div class="mb-2 flex ui-feature-icon"><!--[--><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide h-7 w-7 lucide-circle-question-mark-icon lucide-circle-question-mark h-7 w-7" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><!--]--></div><p class="text-bold text-xl text-foreground-strong">Quizzes</p><p>Take multiple-choice quizzes on job-relevant topics of your choice</p></div></div></div><p class="mt-4 mb-8 px-4 text-center text-lg text-muted-foreground"> Just want to practice? Try our <a href="/practice" class="textlink">coding challenges here</a>. </p><!--]--></div></section><div class="absolute w-full bg-center -mt-4" style="background-image:url(/_nuxt/woodendivider.CUsRAV17.webp);height:23px;" src="/_nuxt/woodendivider.CUsRAV17.webp" alt="Wooden Divider"></div><section class="bg-image-black"><!--[--><!--]--><div class="container mx-auto flex flex-col items-center px-4 pb-24 text-shadow-sm lg:pb-28 pt-16 lg:pt-24"><!----><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><h2 class="max-w-xs text-xl leading-none text-foreground-strong lg:max-w-2xl lg:text-4xl">Taught by the best</h2><h3 class="font-style-normal mt-6 max-w-xs text-base text-foreground md:max-w-lg lg:text-xl">Modern courses taught by engineers who worked at companies like Netflix and SourceGraph</h3><!----></div><div class="mt-4 sm:mt-8 lg:mt-10"></div><!--[--><div class="my-8 flex flex-col items-center"><div class="mb-16 flex flex-col gap-8 text-center text-muted-foreground lg:flex-row"><div><a href="/teachers/the-primeagen" class=""><img src="/_nuxt/theprimeagen.CNjxfHma.webp" alt="The Primeagen" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="mb-2 w-40 cursor-pointer justify-center rounded-full border border-transparent hover:border-ring"></a><p>The Primeagen</p></div><div><a href="/teachers/lane-wagner" class=""><img src="/_nuxt/lanewagner.C8JPPl6G.webp" alt="Lane Wagner" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="mb-2 w-40 cursor-pointer justify-center rounded-full border border-transparent hover:border-ring"></a><p>Lane Wagner</p></div><div><a href="/teachers/tj-devries" class=""><img src="/_nuxt/tjdevries.ZCy-CREV.webp" alt="TJ DeVries" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="mb-2 w-40 cursor-pointer justify-center rounded-full border border-transparent hover:border-ring"></a><p>TJ DeVries</p></div><div><a href="/teachers/sarah-schulte" class=""><img src="/_nuxt/badcop.4eJQluy7.webp" alt="Sarah Schulte" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="mb-2 w-40 cursor-pointer justify-center rounded-full border border-transparent hover:border-ring"></a><p>Sarah Schulte</p></div></div><div class="mb-8 hidden flex-row justify-between gap-8 lg:flex"><div class="flex flex-row gap-3 border border-light-gold bg-image-blue p-3 ui-landing-card-shadow classic:shadow-dark-gold"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Python Logo" class="h-12 w-12"><div><p class="font-bold">Learn Python</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">179 Lessons</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-row gap-3 border border-light-gold bg-image-blue p-3 ui-landing-card-shadow classic:shadow-dark-gold"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Golang Logo" class="h-12 w-12"><div><p class="font-bold">Learn Go</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">188 Lessons</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-row gap-3 border border-light-gold bg-image-blue p-3 ui-landing-card-shadow classic:shadow-dark-gold"><img src="/_nuxt/javascript-128.V87pKiyJ.png" alt="JS Logo" class="h-12 w-12"><div><p class="font-bold">Learn JavaScript</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">122 Lessons</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-row gap-3 border border-light-gold bg-image-blue p-3 ui-landing-card-shadow classic:shadow-dark-gold"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="TypeScript Logo" class="h-12 w-12"><div><p class="font-bold">Learn TypeScript</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">104 Lessons</p></div></div></div><div class="mb-8 hidden flex-row justify-between gap-8 lg:flex"><div class="flex flex-row gap-3 border border-light-gold bg-image-blue p-3 ui-landing-card-shadow classic:shadow-dark-gold"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Terminal Logo" class="h-12 w-12"><div><p class="font-bold">Learn Linux</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">66 Lessons</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-row gap-3 border border-light-gold bg-image-blue p-3 ui-landing-card-shadow classic:shadow-dark-gold"><img src="/_nuxt/postgres-128.BeBrMpfp.png" alt="SQL Logo" class="h-12 w-12"><div><p class="font-bold">Learn SQL</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">125 Lessons</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-row gap-3 border border-light-gold bg-image-blue p-3 ui-landing-card-shadow classic:shadow-dark-gold"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Git Logo" class="h-12 w-12"><div><p class="font-bold">Learn Git</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">75 Lessons</p></div></div></div><div class="mb-8 hidden flex-row justify-between gap-8 lg:flex"><div class="flex flex-row gap-3 border border-light-gold bg-image-blue p-3 ui-landing-card-shadow classic:shadow-dark-gold"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Docker Logo" class="h-12 w-12"><div><p class="font-bold">Learn Docker</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">43 Lessons</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-row gap-3 border border-light-gold bg-image-blue p-3 ui-landing-card-shadow classic:shadow-dark-gold"><img src="/_nuxt/kubernetes-128.DFK_d3qU.png" alt="Kubernetes Logo" class="h-12 w-12"><div><p class="font-bold">Learn Kubernetes</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">66 Lessons</p></div></div><div class="flex flex-row gap-3 border border-light-gold bg-image-blue p-3 ui-landing-card-shadow classic:shadow-dark-gold"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Python Logo" class="h-12 w-12"><div><p class="font-bold">Learn DSA</p><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">175 Lessons</p></div></div></div><p class="hidden text-muted-foreground lg:block">and many more...</p></div><!--]--></div></section><div class="absolute w-full bg-center -mt-4" style="background-image:url(/_nuxt/woodendivider.CUsRAV17.webp);height:23px;" src="/_nuxt/woodendivider.CUsRAV17.webp" alt="Wooden Divider"></div><section class="bg-image-blue"><!--[--><!--]--><div class="container mx-auto flex flex-col items-center px-4 pb-24 text-shadow-sm lg:pb-28 pt-16 lg:pt-24"><!----><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><h2 class="max-w-xs text-xl leading-none text-foreground-strong lg:max-w-2xl lg:text-4xl">How do I learn to code?</h2><h3 class="font-style-normal mt-6 max-w-xs text-base text-foreground md:max-w-lg lg:text-xl">Our answer, from the team behind 1,408,125+ learners</h3><!----></div><div class="mt-4 sm:mt-8 lg:mt-10"></div><!--[--><div class="flex max-w-2xl flex-col gap-8 px-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground"><p> Pick one language (Python is our first choice) and spend most of your time writing code, not watching videos or generating AI slop. Follow a structured path, build real projects along the way, and practice daily. </p><ol class="flex list-decimal flex-col gap-4 pl-5"><li><strong class="text-foreground">Pick one language and stick with it.</strong> Python is a great first language: the syntax is simple, and it&#39;s used everywhere from backend development to scripting, data, and AI. </li><li><strong class="text-foreground">Follow a structured path.</strong> Random tutorials leave knowledge gaps. A linear curriculum removes the &quot;what should I learn next?&quot; problem entirely. </li><li><strong class="text-foreground">Write code every day.</strong> Programming is a skill that takes real time to learn. Shortcuts are mostly a lie. Daily practice beats occasional binge-sessions. </li><li><strong class="text-foreground">Build real projects.</strong> Projects force you to solve problems that no tutorial covers, and they become the portfolio that gets you interviews. </li><li><strong class="text-foreground">Get unstuck fast.</strong> Every developer gets stuck. Lean on a community of humans or a (socratic) AI tutor to keep from stalling out. </li><li><strong class="text-foreground">Go deep on one specialty.</strong> Once you have the fundamentals, specialize. Backend development, DevOps, Data Analysis, Full Stack, AI, etc. Pick one and go deep. </li></ol><p> Want the full step-by-step roadmap? Read our free guide: <a href="/blog/education/how-to-learn-to-code/" class="textlink">How to Learn to Code in 2026</a>. </p></div><div class="mt-4 flex justify-center"><!--[--><div class="mt-8 mb-16 flex flex-col items-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><a href="/demo" class="arcuata group relative flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-xs border-2 ui-hero-button px-9 py-3 text-center text-base font-bold tracking-widest whitespace-nowrap focus:outline-hidden" tabindex="-1"><div class="absolute left-0 hidden border-y-8 border-l-8 border-y-transparent ui-hero-decoration group-focus-within:block group-hover:block"></div><div class="absolute right-0 hidden border-y-8 border-r-8 border-y-transparent ui-hero-decoration group-focus-within:block group-hover:block"></div><button class="uppercase focus:outline-hidden"><!--[--><!--[-->WRITE SOME CODE<!--]--><!--]--></button></a></div><span class="text-muted-foreground"> (it takes 2 minutes) </span></div><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><div class="absolute w-full bg-center -mt-4" style="background-image:url(/_nuxt/woodendivider.CUsRAV17.webp);height:23px;" src="/_nuxt/woodendivider.CUsRAV17.webp" alt="Wooden Divider"></div><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 z-0 h-560 w-full bg-image-blue-gray"></div><section class="relative z-10"><!--[--><!--]--><div class="container mx-auto flex flex-col items-center px-4 pb-24 text-shadow-sm lg:pb-28 pt-16 lg:pt-24"><!----><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><h2 class="max-w-xs text-xl leading-none text-foreground-strong lg:max-w-2xl lg:text-4xl">Frequently asked questions</h2><h3 class="font-style-normal mt-6 max-w-xs text-base text-foreground md:max-w-lg lg:text-xl">Got questions? We&#39;ve got answers</h3><!----></div><div class="mt-4 sm:mt-8 lg:mt-10"></div><!--[--><div class="relative overflow-hidden md:w-[560px] my-12"><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 h-400 w-full bg-image-blue"></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-3 px-4 py-8 shadow-sm md:w-[560px] md:gap-6 md:p-12 border border-light-gold bg-transparent"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-2 px-4 md:p-0"><!--[--><button class="flex w-full flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 p-0 text-start md:w-[464px] md:justify-end" aria-expanded="true"><h5 class="tracking[0.02em] text-[20px]/[28px] font-extrabold md:w-[416px]"><!--[-->Can I sign up and try Boot.dev for free?<!--]--></h5><div class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[10px]"><div class="text-primary-ink flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-between px-1.5 py-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down-icon lucide-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 overflow-hidden md:w-[464px] max-h-[1000px] text-muted-foreground" style=""><!--[--><p>Yes! It&#39;s free to create an account and start learning. You&#39;ll get all the immersive and interactive features for free for a few chapters. After that, if you still haven&#39;t paid for a membership, you&#39;ll be in read-only (content only) mode.</p><!----><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><hr class="bg-light-gold mx-4 my-4 h-px w-full justify-center border-0 md:w-[464px] md:px-0"><!--]--><!--[--><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-2 px-4 md:p-0"><!--[--><button class="flex w-full flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 p-0 text-start md:w-[464px] md:justify-end" aria-expanded="false"><h5 class="tracking[0.02em] text-[20px]/[28px] font-extrabold md:w-[416px]"><!--[-->How do I teach myself to code?<!--]--></h5><div class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[10px]"><div class="text-primary-ink flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-between px-1.5 py-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-up-icon lucide-chevron-up" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 overflow-hidden md:w-[464px] max-h-0 text-muted-foreground" style="display:none;"><!--[--><p>Pick one language, follow a structured curriculum, and spend most of your study time actually writing code instead of watching videos about code. Most self-taught learners fail from a lack of structure, not a lack of talent - jumping between random tutorials leaves gaps. A guided path with hands-on projects keeps you learning in the right order and proves your skills as you go.</p><ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5"><!--[--><li><a href="/blog/education/how-to-learn-to-code/" class="textlink">How to learn to code in 2026</a></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><hr class="bg-light-gold mx-4 my-4 h-px w-full justify-center border-0 md:w-[464px] md:px-0"><!--]--><!--[--><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-2 px-4 md:p-0"><!--[--><button class="flex w-full flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 p-0 text-start md:w-[464px] md:justify-end" aria-expanded="false"><h5 class="tracking[0.02em] text-[20px]/[28px] font-extrabold md:w-[416px]"><!--[-->Can I learn to code on my own?<!--]--></h5><div class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[10px]"><div class="text-primary-ink flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-between px-1.5 py-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-up-icon lucide-chevron-up" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 overflow-hidden md:w-[464px] max-h-0 text-muted-foreground" style="display:none;"><!--[--><p>Yes. You don&#39;t need a computer science degree or an in-person bootcamp - plenty of working developers are self-taught. What you do need is a structured path so you learn things in the right order, consistent daily practice, and a community to get you unstuck when you hit a wall. That combination is exactly what Boot.dev is built to provide.</p><!----><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><hr class="bg-light-gold mx-4 my-4 h-px w-full justify-center border-0 md:w-[464px] md:px-0"><!--]--><!--[--><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-2 px-4 md:p-0"><!--[--><button class="flex w-full flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 p-0 text-start md:w-[464px] md:justify-end" aria-expanded="false"><h5 class="tracking[0.02em] text-[20px]/[28px] font-extrabold md:w-[416px]"><!--[-->How long does it take to learn to code?<!--]--></h5><div class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[10px]"><div class="text-primary-ink flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-between px-1.5 py-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-up-icon lucide-chevron-up" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 overflow-hidden md:w-[464px] max-h-0 text-muted-foreground" style="display:none;"><!--[--><p>You can learn the basics of one programming language in about 3 months of consistent practice. Becoming job-ready takes longer: many people complete an entire career path in about 12 months while studying part-time. The biggest factor isn&#39;t talent, it&#39;s how consistently you show up to practice.</p><ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5"><!--[--><li><a href="/blog/backend/how-long-to-become-backend-dev/" class="textlink">How long to become a backend developer</a></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><hr class="bg-light-gold mx-4 my-4 h-px w-full justify-center border-0 md:w-[464px] md:px-0"><!--]--><!--[--><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-2 px-4 md:p-0"><!--[--><button class="flex w-full flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 p-0 text-start md:w-[464px] md:justify-end" aria-expanded="false"><h5 class="tracking[0.02em] text-[20px]/[28px] font-extrabold md:w-[416px]"><!--[-->Can I learn to code for free?<!--]--></h5><div class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[10px]"><div class="text-primary-ink flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-between px-1.5 py-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-up-icon lucide-chevron-up" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 overflow-hidden md:w-[464px] max-h-0 text-muted-foreground" style="display:none;"><!--[--><p>Yes. It&#39;s free to create a Boot.dev account, the first chapters of every course are fully interactive at no cost, and you can read all of the course content for free in read-only mode. A paid membership unlocks the full interactive experience: coding exercises, projects, quizzes, and certificates.</p><ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5"><!--[--><li><a href="/blog/education/is-boot-dev-free/" class="textlink">Read about free course access</a></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><hr class="bg-light-gold mx-4 my-4 h-px w-full justify-center border-0 md:w-[464px] md:px-0"><!--]--><!--[--><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-2 px-4 md:p-0"><!--[--><button class="flex w-full flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 p-0 text-start md:w-[464px] md:justify-end" aria-expanded="false"><h5 class="tracking[0.02em] text-[20px]/[28px] font-extrabold md:w-[416px]"><!--[-->Hasn&#39;t AI made learning to code obsolete?<!--]--></h5><div class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[10px]"><div class="text-primary-ink flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-between px-1.5 py-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-up-icon lucide-chevron-up" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 overflow-hidden md:w-[464px] max-h-0 text-muted-foreground" style="display:none;"><!--[--><p>We use AI more than most tech companies - not just to build Boots and the Training Grounds, but also to assist us in our coding work... and we&#39;re still hiring developers! The demand for technical talent hasn&#39;t gone away. Companies need developers that are AI savvy and can modernize their codebases. The way developers work is changing rapidly, but the demand for developers who can build great software remains high. We teach software development skills for the modern AI assisted world, and also have some AI specific courses like how to build your own Agent.</p><!----><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><hr class="bg-light-gold mx-4 my-4 h-px w-full justify-center border-0 md:w-[464px] md:px-0"><!--]--><!--[--><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-2 px-4 md:p-0"><!--[--><button class="flex w-full flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 p-0 text-start md:w-[464px] md:justify-end" aria-expanded="false"><h5 class="tracking[0.02em] text-[20px]/[28px] font-extrabold md:w-[416px]"><!--[-->Should I include Boot.dev projects in my resume and portfolio?<!--]--></h5><div class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[10px]"><div class="text-primary-ink flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-between px-1.5 py-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-up-icon lucide-chevron-up" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 overflow-hidden md:w-[464px] max-h-0 text-muted-foreground" style="display:none;"><!--[--><p>Absolutely! If you built it, use it. You&#39;ll build several personal projects while completing our curriculum, and our final course about finding jobs will show you how to construct a job-ready portfolio.</p><!----><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><hr class="bg-light-gold mx-4 my-4 h-px w-full justify-center border-0 md:w-[464px] md:px-0"><!--]--><!--[--><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-2 px-4 md:p-0"><!--[--><button class="flex w-full flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 p-0 text-start md:w-[464px] md:justify-end" aria-expanded="false"><h5 class="tracking[0.02em] text-[20px]/[28px] font-extrabold md:w-[416px]"><!--[-->What is Boot.dev? A bootcamp? An online school?<!--]--></h5><div class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[10px]"><div class="text-primary-ink flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-between px-1.5 py-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-up-icon lucide-chevron-up" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 overflow-hidden md:w-[464px] max-h-0 text-muted-foreground" style="display:none;"><!--[--><p>We&#39;re not a $10,000 bootcamp. We&#39;re not a $50,000 university degree. We are a self-paced, gamified online learning platform for learning programming and computer science. You can learn with us for the price of a gym membership.</p><!----><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><hr class="bg-light-gold mx-4 my-4 h-px w-full justify-center border-0 md:w-[464px] md:px-0"><!--]--><!--[--><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-2 px-4 md:p-0"><!--[--><button class="flex w-full flex-row items-start justify-between gap-4 p-0 text-start md:w-[464px] md:justify-end" aria-expanded="false"><h5 class="tracking[0.02em] text-[20px]/[28px] font-extrabold md:w-[416px]"><!--[-->What makes Boot.dev different?<!--]--></h5><div class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[10px]"><div class="text-primary-ink flex h-8 w-8 flex-col items-center justify-between px-1.5 py-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-up-icon lucide-chevron-up" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 overflow-hidden md:w-[464px] max-h-0 text-muted-foreground" style="display:none;"><!--[--><p>We focus on teaching backend-development and data-related skills, which is somewhat of a rarity in online learning. We&#39;re also focused on solving what we believe is the hardest problem with online learning: boredom. If you prefer coding rather than watching, and your struggle with online learning is staying engaged and finding high-quality resources, we think you&#39;ll like learning with us.</p><ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5"><!--[--><li><a href="/about" class="textlink">Read about our methodology</a></li><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><!----><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></div></div><div class="mb-8 max-w-4xl"><div class="mt-8 mb-16 flex flex-col items-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><a href="/demo" class="arcuata group relative flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-xs border-2 ui-hero-button px-9 py-3 text-center text-base font-bold tracking-widest whitespace-nowrap focus:outline-hidden" tabindex="-1"><div class="absolute left-0 hidden border-y-8 border-l-8 border-y-transparent ui-hero-decoration group-focus-within:block group-hover:block"></div><div class="absolute right-0 hidden border-y-8 border-r-8 border-y-transparent ui-hero-decoration group-focus-within:block group-hover:block"></div><button class="uppercase focus:outline-hidden"><!--[--><!--[-->WRITE SOME CODE<!--]--><!--]--></button></a></div><span class="text-muted-foreground"> (it takes 2 minutes) </span></div></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="absolute w-full bg-center -mt-4" style="background-image:url(/_nuxt/woodendivider.CUsRAV17.webp);height:23px;" src="/_nuxt/woodendivider.CUsRAV17.webp" alt="Wooden Divider"></div><section class="footer-section bg-image-black"><!--[--><!--]--><div class="container mx-auto flex flex-col items-center px-4 pb-24 text-shadow-sm lg:pb-28 pt-16 lg:pt-24"><!----><!----><div class="mt-4 sm:mt-8 lg:mt-10"></div><!--[--><section class="isolate box-border flex flex-col items-start gap-16 p-8 lg:p-12"><div class="grid w-full grid-cols-2 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12 xl:grid-cols-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground-strong">Platform</h3><nav class="flex flex-col gap-2"><!--[--><a aria-current="page" href="/" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active textlink text-sm text-muted-foreground no-underline hover:underline">Learn to Code</a><a href="/courses" class="textlink text-sm text-muted-foreground no-underline hover:underline">All Courses</a><a href="/practice" class="textlink text-sm text-muted-foreground no-underline hover:underline">Practice</a><a href="/paths/backend?tech=python-golang" class="textlink text-sm text-muted-foreground no-underline hover:underline">Backend Path (Python/Go)</a><a href="/paths/backend?tech=python-typescript" class="textlink text-sm text-muted-foreground no-underline hover:underline">Backend Path (Python/TS)</a><a href="/paths/devops?tech=python-golang" class="textlink text-sm text-muted-foreground no-underline hover:underline">DevOps Path (Python/Go)</a><a href="/paths/data-analyst?tech=python" class="textlink text-sm text-muted-foreground no-underline hover:underline">Data Analyst Path (Python)</a><a href="/leaderboard" class="textlink text-sm text-muted-foreground no-underline hover:underline">Leaderboard</a><a href="/practice/search" class="textlink text-sm text-muted-foreground no-underline hover:underline">Search Challenges</a><a href="/playground/py" class="textlink text-sm text-muted-foreground no-underline hover:underline">Playground</a><!--]--></nav><div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-4"><!--[--><a href="https://twitter.com/bootdotdev" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="text-foreground transition-colors hover:opacity-90"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" xml:space="preserve" fill="white" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M14.095479,10.316482L22.286354,1h-1.940718l-7.115352,8.087682L7.551414,1H1l8.589488,12.231093L1,23h1.940717  l7.509372-8.542861L16.448587,23H23L14.095479,10.316482z M11.436522,13.338465l-0.871624-1.218704l-6.924311-9.68815h2.981339  l5.58978,7.82155l0.867949,1.218704l7.26506,10.166271h-2.981339L11.436522,13.338465z"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Boot.dev on X/Twitter</span></a><a href="https://youtube.com/@bootdotdev" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="text-foreground transition-colors hover:opacity-90"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" viewbox="0 0 461.001 461.001" xml:space="preserve" style="fill:currentColor;" class="h-5 w-5"><g><path d="M365.257,67.393H95.744C42.866,67.393,0,110.259,0,163.137v134.728
