eginners","learn-python-beginners",{"uuid":21,"createdAt":10,"rating":11,"publicReview":22,"firstName":23,"lastName":24,"profileImageURL":25,"location":16,"handle":26,"courseTitle":18,"courseSlug":19},"3c3e42aa-f3e8-4499-8975-3b5f2c4ac3d8","Amazing, approachable overview to Python. The game system makes it fun, and the challenges were just hard enough to enjoy.","Hayden","Conley","https:\u002F\u002Fstorage.googleapis.com\u002Fqvault-webapp-dynamic-assets\u002Fprofile_images\u002F6c5e7182-99d5-4f6d-a743-98d3e6a62228.jpeg","cooperativedraw20",{"uuid":28,"createdAt":10,"rating":11,"publicReview":29,"firstName":30,"lastName":31,"profileImageURL":32,"location":16,"handle":33,"courseTitle":18,"courseSlug":19},"67252f42-1b32-4a5e-b9bd-8c9c63048b4c","Pretty decent challenges for a beginner course","mickx","","https:\u002F\u002Fstorage.googleapis.com\u002Fqvault-webapp-dynamic-assets\u002Fprofile_images\u002Fea5d5649-e595-4e7d-9039-09df5211f6a4.png","finelibrary99",{"uuid":35,"createdAt":10,"rating":36,"publicReview":37,"firstName":38,"lastName":39,"profileImageURL":40,"location":16,"handle":41,"courseTitle":18,"courseSlug":19},"0a52e4c1-06cc-45fa-84be-ee33fc66c114",4,"Could be a tad shorter and add just a touch of classes at the end. ","erik","mac","https:\u002F\u002Fstorage.googleapis.com\u002Fqvault-webapp-dynamic-assets\u002Fprofile_images\u002Fefaee247-bb33-4158-8a58-d9c84a0b7422.png","pitifulrecipe26",{"uuid":43,"createdAt":44,"rating":11,"publicReview":45,"firstName":46,"lastName":47,"profileImageURL":48,"location":49,"handle":50,"courseTitle":51,"courseSlug":52},"cafb5f0e-8cbe-4ed5-9877-f9460a4fbf56","2026-11-19","This was a great course that taught me a lot about SQL. I feel a lot more confident writing SQL queries and understanding them now!","Hugh","Gramelspacher","https:\u002F\u002Favatars.githubusercontent.com\u002Fu\u002F153408765?v=4","Seattle, WA","hugh","Learn SQL","learn-sql",{"uuid":54,"createdAt":44,"rating":36,"publicReview":55,"firstName":56,"lastName":57,"profileImageURL":58,"location":59,"handle":60,"courseTitle":61,"courseSlug":62},"9431b4b5-709c-4a9e-85bd-7f39c7161c0b","i don't know why i have done this course but very well","Muhammad","Burhan Qamar","https:\u002F\u002Favatars.githubusercontent.com\u002Fu\u002F283143595?v=4","Pakistan","wonderfulnews57","Learn Go","learn-golang",{"uuid":64,"createdAt":44,"rating":11,"publicReview":65,"firstName":66,"lastName":67,"profileImageURL":68,"location":69,"handle":70,"courseTitle":18,"courseSlug":19},"f81d05bf-f3b1-41b4-8db6-59b7b5cc1408","I really liked the dynamics and content of the course. Even though I struggle with reading in English, it was relatively easy to grasp most of the concepts. Furthermore, the variety of exercises, the different class formats, the quizzes, and so on, kept me thoroughly engaged. I thought it would take me about a month to complete, but I finished it in less than a week because the format is so entertaining.","Kevin","Hernandez","https:\u002F\u002Fstorage.googleapis.com\u002Fqvault-webapp-dynamic-assets\u002Fprofile_images\u002F732ae9e6-b496-40df-80cd-4a7a1c68710b.jpeg","México","tomas_kevin",{"uuid":72,"createdAt":44,"rating":11,"publicReview":73,"firstName":74,"lastName":75,"profileImageURL":76,"location":77,"handle":78,"courseTitle":61,"courseSlug":62},"b819ae94-d939-436c-8c96-90988dafe6b3","The course gave me a good starting point for learning the fundamentals of Go. It's fun, and there's still a lot to learn!","Henson","Lao","https:\u002F\u002Favatars.githubusercontent.com\u002Fu\u002F288280294?v=4","Philippines","lhnsnm",{"uuid":80,"createdAt":44,"rating":11,"publicReview":81,"firstName":82,"lastName":83,"profileImageURL":84,"location":85,"handle":86,"courseTitle":18,"courseSlug":19},"9e8193f7-bc71-42f6-8de7-57e5128fb540","for 10 years trying to learn python code(sad) this platfrom is by far the best way to learn python, it keeps you motivated and wanting more. ","ALI","ABDI","https:\u002F\u002Fstorage.googleapis.com\u002Fqvault-we